#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000133
msgid ""
"A weekly pulp magazine filled to the brim with outlandish and absurd sci-fi/horror stories.  Roughly half of the stories are about men fighting Martians and are written by amateurs.  Not to be taken too seriously.  Lurid and sexually suggestive themes are a given.\n"
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000134
#: olang/00d345a5/0x017f53/0x000134
msgid "A monthly pulp magazine that features mature content aimed at literary types. The real-life travel logs submitted by soldiers from around the world are a must read.  Also boasts an ample supply of scantily-clad pin-ups."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x017f53/0x000135
msgid "A quarterly men's lifestyle magazine aimed at discriminating adults. Features include articles on news, politics, and special interests such as the ever-popular \"bonsai\" corner.  Naturally, it also features its fare share of \"adult content.\""
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000054
msgid ""
"Jigsaw made of steel wire. \n"
"Alternate pressing <I=SAW_L> and <I=SAW_R> to use."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000081
msgid ""
"Shield made from bulletproof material. \n"
"Press <I=AIM> to use. \n"
"The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x000086
#: olang/00d345a5/0x048941/0x000086
msgid "Shield made from bulletproof material (colored). Press the Aim Button to use. The direction protected varies according to weapon equipped."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x048941/0x0001af
msgid "Original t-shirt design. Identical in basic characteristics to Jungle Fatigues. "
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000000
msgid "Next we'll work on your movement."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000001
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62c97d/0x000001
msgid "Use <I=MOVE> to move around."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000002
msgid "Use <I=WALK> to walk slowly."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000003
msgid ""
"Decide which to use \n"
"based on your situation."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000004
msgid ""
"Remember that your footsteps are louder\n"
"when running, making you easier to discover."
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765b1/0x000005
msgid "Be careful!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/009c9ea4/0x0765d1/0x000000
#: olang/009c9ea4/0x62cb7d/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, you can use \n"
"<I=MOVE> to move!"
msgstr ""

