"repeatedly and take down your opponent!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x62dafe/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button without moving!  "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000001
msgid "position yourself near your opponent \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000002
msgid ""
"and press the Attack Button \n"
"while you tilt the left stick."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x644bfd/0x000003
msgid ""
"Be sure to press the Attack Button \n"
"when the icon appears."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6457fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6457fe/0x000000
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6458fd/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Attack Button \n"
"as you tilt the left stick!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6458fe/0x000001
msgid ""
"you have to press the Hand-to-hand Attack \n"
"Button as you tilt the left stick!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000000
msgid "To restrain your opponent,\r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000001
msgid ""
"hold down the Hand-to-hand \n"
"Attack Button while near them. \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x645bfe/0x000002
msgid ""
"Restrain your opponent \n"
"on my command. \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64687e/0x000001
msgid ""
"Press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button\n"
"while near your opponent! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x6468fe/0x000001
