"you'll have to take them on one \n"
"after the other. \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000002
msgid "To do it, \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000003
msgid ""
"simply press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"again while throwing the current enemy.\r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64a97e/0x000004
msgid ""
"Just be sure to wait for the Icon \n"
"to appear. \r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00cd740b/0x64ab7e/0x000000
msgid ""
"Boss, \r\n"
"press the Hand-to-hand Attack Button \n"
"when the icon appears! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bd8
msgid ""
"Could it be...\r\n"
"the great cacique...\r\n"
"has come to lead us…"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bd9
msgid ""
"We are few in number, but we will win. \r\n"
"Victoria o muerte. For a revolutionary, there is no other fate."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x052bda
msgid ""
"Revolution is a means and not an end, I know. \r\n"
"When the revolution is victorious,I want my country to be at peace.\r\n"
"But to bring peace, we have to first eliminate that traitorous scum."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b558
msgid "Listen up. For us, there is no victory."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b559
msgid ""
"We gave up our homes. \r\n"
"But we're still alive.\r\n"
"We're still fighting.\r\n"
"And there's always another reason \r\n"
"to keep on living."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b55a
msgid ""
"Revolution or no revolution, you pick up a gun,\n"
"and sooner or later you're going to hell."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x06b55b
msgid ""
"We go where we're needed, \r\n"
"fighting not for country, not for government,\r\n"
"but for ourselves.\r"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f416
msgid ""
"My name is Paz, and I will do anything\r\n"
"to protect my namesake. \r\n"
"It is my one and only purpose."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f417
msgid ""
"Crying about it won't bring it about, or make it last.\r\n"
"Each one of us must go and seek it out."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x21f418
msgid ""
"Do not worry about me... I am an angel of peace.\n"
"I will be watching over you."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374f9e
msgid ""
"That's why I agreed to help develop it... \r\n"
"Mm-hmm. However, in order to achieve\r\n"
"that perfect deterrent, \r\n"
"we must show the world our strength."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374f9f
msgid ""
"...Peace won't just come to us, doc.\r\n"
"We are going to have to go meet it halfway."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa0
msgid "No, machines don't make mistakes. Only men do."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa1
msgid ""
"The age of heroes is over, buried alongside\r\n"
"The Boss and her bankrupt beliefs."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x374fa2
msgid ""
"In the end, it's not their lives that \r\n"
"people value most... it's their reputations!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x863cee
msgid ""
"We know who you are, Big Boss.\r\n"
"That is why we've come to you."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x863cef
msgid ""
"Central America is the navel\r\n"
"of the American continents, \r\n"
"bridging North and South.\r\n"
"We want this land."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c53e
msgid ""
"Yes, I know. Just as I know \r\n"
"what you did 10 years ago.\r\n"
"Go on, kill me like you killed her.\r\n"
"Kill me like you killed The Boss.\r\n"
"Kill me!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c53f
msgid ""
"That filthy title given you as reward for murder…\n"
"Do you still wear it with pride?"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c540
msgid ""
"You used the pretext of a mission \r\n"
"to kill a true hero.\r\n"
"Is that what you call loyalty? Answer me!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c541
msgid ""
"I won't rest until I get answers \r\n"
"from the woman I loved. \r\n"
"You and I are the same. We are the walking dead."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c542
msgid ""
"I have no use for fabrications...\r\n"
"I want the truth... The Boss' last will."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0x91c543
msgid ""
"I'm only interested in one thing.\r\n"
"The truth."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d965
msgid ""
"...Everyone treats me like a child.\r\n"
"I, I, I couldn't stand it anymore. \r\n"
"I'm not a kid. I'm twelve! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d966
msgid ""
"Let me know if you encounter\n"
"any wildlife you've never seen before."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d967
msgid "When I grow up, I wanna be a hunter."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb2d968
msgid ""
"The enemy could strike at any time.\r\n"
"I can't sit around taking my sweet time eating!"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949db
msgid ""
"I've been thinking of giving up on studying birds\n"
"and learning to fly myself."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949dc
msgid ""
"Becoming one with the forest is the very essence of birdwatching,\n"
"they won't behave naturally if they sense a human nearby.\n"
"And that can really affect your observations."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949dd
msgid ""
"I think it is an insult to the birds to give\n"
"their names to weapons, don't you?"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xb949de
msgid "You people are such culinary savages! "
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f415
msgid ""
"What, you'd rather keep wandering \r\n"
"from conflict to conflict,\r\n"
"tools in the hands of whoever's \r\n"
"fighting at the time?"
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f416
msgid ""
"Exactly. We know only how to fight... \r\n"
"but we refuse to live our lives at the whim of the state."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f417
msgid ""
"No one man could bear the burden of total genocide. \r\n"
"It's what's allowed our cowardly species to survive all this time."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f418
msgid ""
"You've left everything behind - your country, your identity,\n"
"your past and ideals... \r\n"
"But there's still one thing you haven't let go of."
msgstr ""

#: olang/00d0c740/0x413acf/0xd1f419
msgid ""
"The truth won't change the past.\n"
"You still want to know?"
msgstr ""

