#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 12580..14168
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/11
msgid ""
"Or - the other way around - ever had your legs cut\n"
"out from under you by a thoughtless remark?\n"
