#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 14349..15645
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/12
msgid ""
"I know the feeling. Words can have a powerful\n"
"mental effect on people.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 15659..16272
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/13
msgid ""
"Same goes for CO-OPS Comms.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 16300..17359
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/14
msgid ""
"Offering praise to somebody could make them run\n"
"faster than usual.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 17373..18822
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/15
msgid ""
"Or make somebody who thinks they're done for get\n"
"up and fight again... See what I'm saying?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 18822..19825
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/16
msgid ""
"I get the picture. So it works in reverse, too.\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_mis_kaz0130_010_1
#. timeline 19853..21329
#: codec/1/169/0xa98c0/17
msgid ""
"The powers of words are many and varied. Try\n"
"using them for yourself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/0
msgid ""
"Up to two people can fit inside a cardboard box.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/1
msgid ""
"Tell me how!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/2
msgid ""
"Move close to a box with a teammate inside and\n"
"an Icon will appear.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/3
msgid ""
"Then press <I=ACT>.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/4
msgid ""
"You'll stay inside as long as <I=ACT> is pressed.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/5
msgid ""
"So... Same as Snake Formation, huh.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/1/170/0xaa690/6
msgid ""
"Exactly the same. In fact, when you put on a\n"
"cardboard box when Snake In,\n"
