#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_kaz0040_000_0
#. timeline 6492..6729
#. speaker 0x0ebd8542 voice v_bri_dsl0030_000_1
#. timeline 1434..1685
#. speaker 0x0e28dce6 voice v_bri_huy0110_000_0
#. timeline 3691..4012
#: codec/1/172/0xaca30/6
#: codec/1/220/0xdc990/1
#: codec/1/249/0xf9500/2
#: codec/2/915/0x393270/15
