"What do you mean?\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_kaz0040_000_0
#. timeline 6729..8038
#: codec/1/172/0xaca30/7
msgid ""
"There's a medieval encyclopedia that describes the\n"
"basilisk like this:\n"
msgstr ""

#. speaker 0x0e463a34 voice v_bri_kaz0040_000_0
#. timeline 8066..9835
#: codec/1/172/0xaca30/8
msgid ""
"\"The basilisk is the king of snakes. All snakes fear\n"
