#: codec/2/921/0x399400/1
msgid ""
"Missions like this are key to building up\n"
"your basic skills.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399400/2
msgid ""
"Be careful out there.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/0
msgid ""
"Commencing mission.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/1
msgid ""
"You're in for some heavy combat with\n"
"this one.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399530/2
msgid ""
"Try and make it back in one piece.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/0
msgid ""
"This is a high-risk mission.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/1
msgid ""
"You'll be facing some powerful opposition.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399660/2
msgid ""
"But it's nothing you can't handle. Believe\n"
"in yourself.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/0
msgid ""
"We've got a... uh, special request for you\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/1
msgid ""
"Yeah...umm...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3997a0/2
msgid ""
"Here, have a look.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/0
msgid ""
"You're not gonna believe this...\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/1
msgid ""
"Suddenly we've got a Gear REX on board\n"
"Mother Base and it's raising hell up on\n"
"the deck.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/2
msgid ""
"I don't know what we did to piss it\n"
"off...but this is the biggest crisis in MSF's\n"
"history.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x3998b0/3
msgid ""
"We need you to hunt it down and save\n"
"our Outer Heaven!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/0
msgid ""
"Last night, a Gear REX came ashore on\n"
"the southern Pacific coast of Costa Rica.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/1
msgid ""
"From there it headed north and reached\n"
"the vicinity of Irazú's crater around noon\n"
"today.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/2
msgid ""
"As of now it's stopped moving.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/3
msgid ""
"Costa Rica doesn't have an army to deal\n"
"with threats this big.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/4
msgid ""
"We're getting dozens of reports of\n"
"damage to nearby houses and other\n"
"buildings.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/5
msgid ""
"For the sake of peace in Costa Rica,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399aa0/6
msgid ""
"we need you to head to the crater and\n"
"get the Gear REX under control!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/0
msgid ""
"It'd be a good idea to do some combat\n"
"training with ZEKE.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/1
msgid ""
"It'll just be a mock battle, though.\n"
"Nothing'll happen to ZEKE for real.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399da0/2
msgid ""
"Attack ZEKE as if you were actually going\n"
"against him, OK?\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/921/0x399f20/0
msgid ""
"dummy\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commences now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the Kill House!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a120/1
#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/1
msgid ""
"When the timer reaches zero, the\n"
"exercise is over.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/0
msgid ""
"Commence target practice.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/1
msgid ""
"As a special treat, you can practice freely\n"
"on any of the targets in the shooting\n"
"range today.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a240/2
msgid ""
"Shoot away! When you're done, head\n"
"over to the exit.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a3b0/0
msgid ""
"Target practice commencing now. Shoot\n"
"all the targets in the shooting range!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/0
msgid ""
"Looks like our reputation is spreading.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/1
msgid ""
"We've got battle-hardened veterans from\n"
"all kinds of places trying to join our army!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/2
msgid ""
"But, they insist on testing your skills to\n"
"see if you're the \"real deal\" before they'll\n"
"join.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/3
msgid ""
"Lets put these arrogant upstarts in their\n"
"place!\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/4
msgid ""
"Take them down using hand-to-hand\n"
"strikes or CQC.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/5
msgid ""
"If you can knock 'em all out within the\n"
"time limit, they'll join us,\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/6
msgid ""
"becoming powerful allies.\n"
msgstr ""

#: codec/2/922/0x39a4d0/7
msgid ""
"Don't disappoint 'em, Boss. Show 'em\n"
"what you got!\n"
msgstr ""
